cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Lab Automation Framework Template and Demo"
abstract: >-
  This package serves as an installable template to adapt the automation
  framework consisting of LabScheduler, Laborchestrator, PythonLab,
  PlatformStatusDataBase and some SiLA-Servers to a new robotic lab. It also
  contains out of the box running demo examples.
